Filetype: IR signals file
Version: 1
# Telekom MagentaTV One (2nd generation) remote, model SRC-3512 (rev 1-A/1-B). Controls the MagentaTV One box over IR.
# The One's IR receiver uses the same codes as the Media Receiver MR200/201/400/401/601 remotes (iptv.blog); 38 kHz,
# 18-bit Manchester frame = constant 11-bit prefix + 7-bit command, half-bit 316 us. Codes decoded from two independent
# Flipper-IRDB captures of Telekom remotes and checked against a Global Cache MR303 power code.
# Not captured from an SRC-3512. The real remote uses Bluetooth for most functions; over IR the box accepts a limited set.
# Not included: Google Assistant / Magenta voice keys (Bluetooth only), colour keys (ignored by the One), TV/last-channel key (IR code unknown).
#
name: Power
type: raw
frequency: 38000
duty_cycle: 0.330000
data: 316 632 316 316 632 316 316 632 316 316 632 632 632 632 316 316 316 316 632 632 632 316 316 632 316
